31:["$","p","p-0",{"children":["Because the Islamic calendar is lunar, ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Ramadan and Hajj move about 11 days earlier each year"}],", so the \"best time\" shifts too. Check the Hijri dates for your year before booking."]}]
