33:["$","p","p-1",{"children":"Many pilgrims save for years to perform Umrah in Ramadan, and a well-known hadith describes Umrah in Ramadan as equal in reward to Hajj. The atmosphere is unlike any other time — but so are the crowds."}]
34:["$","p","p-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"For transport this means:"}]," heavy congestion around the Haram, especially around iftar, taraweeh and the late-night prayers; wider road closures; and much higher demand for cars. Book transfers early, plan pickups well away from prayer times, and expect the last stretch to your hotel to take longer."]}]
35:["$","h2","h2-2",{"id":"the-cooler-months","children":"The cooler months"}]
36:["$","p","p-3",{"children":"The best balance for most families. Daytime highs around 30°C make walking to the Haram and Tawaf in the open courtyard much easier for children and older relatives, and evenings are pleasant. December school holidays are busy — book early."}]
37:["$","p","p-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"For transport:"}]," good conditions for long road legs such as ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/blog/madinah-to-makkah-taxi-price-distance-time","children":"Madinah to Makkah"}],", and for daytime ",["$","$L26","a-1",{"href":"/blog/makkah-ziyarat-taxi-holy-sites-tour","children":"Ziyarat"}],". See our ",["$","$L26","a-2",{"href":"/blog/umrah-season-autumn-winter-family-group-transport","children":"autumn and winter transport plan"}],"."]}]
38:["$","h2","h2-3",{"id":"the-weeks-after-hajj","children":"The weeks after Hajj"}]
39:["$","p","p-5",{"children":"When the Umrah season reopens after Hajj, numbers are at their lowest and hotels are at their cheapest. It can be very hot, depending on where the lunar calendar falls."}]
3a:["$","p","p-6",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"For transport:"}]," the easiest time to reach your hotel by car and to find vehicles at short notice — but do Ziyarat early in the morning."]}]
3b:["$","h2","h2-4",{"id":"summer","children":"Summer"}]
3c:["$","p","p-7",{"children":"Daytime heat regularly passes 40°C. Many pilgrims perform Umrah late at night and rest during the day."}]
3d:["$","p","p-8",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"For transport:"}]," air-conditioned door-to-door transfers matter more, and night arrivals are common — book a pickup that matches your flight, share your flight number, and we check it before pickup."]}]
