41:["$","p","p-9",{"children":["Most pilgrims fly into ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Jeddah (JED)"}],", about 80 km and roughly an hour from Makkah — see our ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/blog/jeddah-taxi-fares-cost-guide","children":"Jeddah fare guide"}]," — or into ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"Madinah (MED)"}]," and travel to Makkah later, passing the Miqat at Abyar Ali. Our ",["$","$L26","a-1",{"href":"/blog/complete-miqat-locations-guide-umrah-pilgrims","children":"Miqat guide"}]," explains where to enter Ihram for each route."]}]
