43:["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"when-is-makkah-least-crowded","children":"When is Makkah least crowded?"}]
44:["$","p","p-10",{"children":"Usually in the weeks after Hajj when the Umrah season reopens — though it is often hot then."}]
45:["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"is-december-a-good-time-for-umrah","children":"Is December a good time for Umrah?"}]
46:["$","p","p-11",{"children":"Weather-wise, yes. It is also a school holiday period, so it is busy; book hotels and transport early."}]
